WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Sam: This is my room, Lucky!

2
00:00:05.401 --> 00:00:09.010
That's your new bed. Dad:

3
00:00:09.011 --> 00:00:12.451
I think he likes it here!

4
00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:14.178
Lucky: Ruff! Ruff!

5
00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:23.566
Sam: He knows what dog treats are!

6
00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:28.066
Dad: Taking care of a pet is a lot of work,

7
00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:33.196
Sam. You must feed Lucky two times a day.

8
00:00:33.197 --> 00:00:36.649
Mom: And walk him three times a day.

9
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:41.211
Here's his collar and leash.

10
00:00:41.212 --> 00:00:44.417
Dad: Remember to keep the gates locked.

11
00:00:44.418 --> 00:00:47.066
We don't want Lucky to run away. Sam:

12
00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:49.585
I will! Tia:

13
00:00:49.586 --> 00:00:54.882
Hi, Sam! Is that your new dog?

14
00:00:54.883 --> 00:00:58.268
Sam: Yes! This is Lucky.

15
00:00:58.269 --> 00:01:04.002
And Lucky, these are my friends, Max and Tia! Mom:

16
00:01:04.003 --> 00:01:07.938
Sorry, Tia! Lucky needs better manners.

17
00:01:07.939 --> 00:01:13.608
Tia: That's okay, Mrs. Nelson! He's cute!

18
00:01:13.609 --> 00:01:16.342
Mom: Good night, Sam.

19
00:01:16.343 --> 00:01:18.408
Sam: Good night, Mom.

20
00:01:18.409 --> 00:01:21.267
Mom: Did Lucky find his new

21
00:01:21.268 --> 00:01:25.940
bed? Sam: Uh . . . Yes,

22
00:01:25.941 --> 00:01:32.382
Mom. Lucky found his bed!

